(
    title: "Missile Command",
    developer: Some("Rob Fulop"),
    description: Some("The player defends six cities from missiles falling out of the sky, steering a crosshair with the joystick and firing counter-missiles that burst where it sits, destroying anything caught in the blast. Ammunition is limited, so shots have to be placed where one explosion will catch several warheads. The game ends once the last city is gone."),
